@BillingService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5048
@productId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@invoiceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

GET {{BillingService_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{BillingService_HostAddress}}/health/ready

###

GET {{BillingService_HostAddress}}/api/invoices?page=1&pageSize=20&status=Open
Accept: application/json

### Substitua productId pelo produto cadastrado no StockService.

POST {{BillingService_HostAddress}}/api/invoices
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: exemplo-nota-001

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Substitua invoiceId pelo id da resposta anterior.

GET {{BillingService_HostAddress}}/api/invoices/{{invoiceId}}

### Sucesso retorna 200 com a nota fechada. Em falha, consulte a nota e repita se estiver aberta.

POST {{BillingService_HostAddress}}/api/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/print
X-Correlation-ID: exemplo-impressao-001
